<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">- Mbunga Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Filimoni</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lihamba lya Paulo kwa Filimoni</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filimoni</para>
  <para style="toc3">Fili</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lihamba lya Paulo kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Filimoni</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Lihamba hai hupi kwa Filimoni iyandikilwi na Mndumindumi Paulo 1:1. Paulo awelili muuwopwa paayandika lihamba hai, inguwesekana lipindi anguyandika awelili mmbwani mkulunga wa Loma. Ikiva Paulo awelili Loma lipindi akiyandika lihamba hai hinu inguwesekana iwelili handa machuva gha 61 badili gha kuwelekwa Kilisito, lipindi lilalila ndiwa kiyandikwa kihitabu kya Wakolosai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Amyandikilili lihamba hai mundu akemilwi Filimoni. Filimoni awelili mmonga wa wandu wa lipinga lya wamkwinila Kilisito na hilahila awelili na wahusutu. Paulo amyandikilili kumluwa akotoho kumnyokola mhusutu ghaki Onesimo, avile katyelembuka kuhuma kwa Filimoni. Kwa laghililo lya Loma limuwesesili Filimoni kumkoma Onesimo. Paulo amluwili nesu Filimoni kwa kumtaya moyu ampokeli Onesimo handa mkilisito myaki na hilahila Paulo kamluwa Filimoni amlekeseli Onesimo tugholi lihengu pamonga na mweni. 1:13-14.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gha mghati</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo angumjambusa Filimoni 1:1-3</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo angutumila fwasi ghaki kumluwa Filimoni ampokeli Onesimo handa mkilisito myaki 1:4-21</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo anguyomola kwa kulongelela lukani lwa kumtyangila Filimoni na kuyegha lijambuso. 1:22-25.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1" />Nenga Paulo, muwopwa kwaikiva gha Kilisito Yesu, pamonga na mlongu Timoseo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHM 1:1">ningukuyandikila wenga Filimoni mpalwa, mghola lihengu pamonga na twenga, <verse eid="PHM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2" />na kwa mhacha wa twenga mpalwa Afia, na mtovangondu myetu ku Kilisito Alikipo na lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito lila lingukongine ukaya kwa wenga.<verse eid="PHM 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3" />Tunguwatakila manemu na kukotoho kutovana kuhuma kwa Sapanga Tati wa twenga, na kwa Bambu Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="PHM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Upalo na kukwinila kwa Filimoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4" />Kila paniwela kumayupo na panikukumbwike wenga Filimoni ningumshukwile Sapanga, <verse eid="PHM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5" />kwaikiva ninguhyoghanila vila ungumkwinila Bambu Yesu na vila unguwapala wandu wogha wamkwinila Kilisito. <verse eid="PHM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6" />Ningukuyupila ili ukwinila hau unguughola pamonga na twenga ukuwesesi kumanya nesu highili zyogha tungupokela patuwela pamonga ku Kilisito. <verse eid="PHM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7" />Upalo ghako, unighola niweli na luheku nesu na kutaywa moyu nesu! Wenga hilahila ugholile mioyu gha wandu wa Sapanga kukalamuka.<verse eid="PHM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo angumluwila Onesimo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8" />Hata nagha ku Kilisito ningaliwesa kukulaghila yala ungupalwa kughola, <verse eid="PHM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9" />ila kwaikiva gha upalo ni mbaha nesu nikuluwi. Ningughola nagha pamonga na nenga Paulo ni mgogolo na hinaa niwopwa kwaikiva gha Kilisito Yesu. <verse eid="PHM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10" />Hinu, nivile na lilando limonga kukuluwa na hali ni kwa hayu mwanaghangu Onesimo, yula avile ni mwanaghangu kuukwinila wa Kilisito, kwaikiva niwela Tati ghaki wa kimpumulo paniwela kuuwopwa. <verse eid="PHM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11" />Ni yula yula Onesimo avile kula dahile awelili wamaha ng'ogha kwa wenga, ila hinaa ni wamaha kwa wenga na kwa nenga hilahila.<verse eid="PHM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12" />Hinaa ningumlaghila kwa wenga, kwaikiva ningumpala kwa moyu ghangu wogha. <verse eid="PHM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13" />Ningalipala alikali baha na nenga ili anitangi akitola fwasi ghako paniwela kuuwopwa kwaikiva gha Habali Maha. <verse eid="PHM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14" />Ila niteghola ng'ogha chochosi mbaka uniyangi yiwa uyitikila. Nenga nipala ng'ogha kukuhukumula hukumula unitangi, kwaikiva ulungwana ghako ungupalwa uwoneki kuhuma mmoyu ghako ng'ogha kuhuma kumhukumulo.<verse eid="PHM 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15" />Pangi Onesimo ahukili kwa wenga lipindi mayaghani hela ili uwesi kangi kuwela na mweni machuwa yayendelela, <verse eid="PHM 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16" />hinaa kamhusutu ng'ogha, ila kamaha kupiti mhusutu, mweni kamlongo wa twenga mpalwa ku Kilisito. Kampalwa kwa nenga, na kwa wenga atevile mpalwa nesu, handa mhusutu na mlongu kuukwinila wa Bambu.<verse eid="PHM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17" />Hinu, ikiva ungunimanya nenga yiwa ni myako ku Kilisito, umpokeli hilahila handa vila unganipokela nenga mweni. <verse eid="PHM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18" />Ikiva awelili kakuhakila, au kawela na hindu ghako angupalwa kuhipa, unongeli nikuhipi. <verse eid="PHM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19" />Ninguyandika mghalu hau kwa liwoku lyangu mweni. Nenga Paulo nitekuhipa. Kangi nitekukumbusa ng'ogha yiwa wenga ungupalwa kuhipa kyokyosi kwa nenga kungalilu ghako. <verse eid="PHM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20" />Mlongo ghangu, ningukuluwa unigholeli mghalu hau kwaikiva gha lihina lya Bambu, ili uhekilesi moyu ghangu handa mlongu ku Kilisito.<verse eid="PHM 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21" />Ninguyandika kunu nikikwinila yiwa uteniyitikila haku kuluwa kwa nenga, na kangi ningumanya yiwa uteghola makulunga hata kupiti hagha ningukuluwa. <verse eid="PHM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22" />Pamonga na hagha, uniyandalili kyumba kya wahenja kwaikiva ningukwinila yiwa kwa mayupo gha mwenga, Sapanga atenihuyisa kwa mwenga handa kuyitikila mayupo gha mwenga.<verse eid="PHM 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jambuso lya mwihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23" />Epafula, muwopwa myangu kwaikiva gha Kilisito Yesu, angukujambusa. <verse eid="PHM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24" />Hilahila na Maliku na Alisitako na Dema na Lukasi, waghola lihengu wayangu, na weni wangukujambusa. <verse eid="PHM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25" />Ninguwatakila mwenga wogha manemu gha Bambu Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="PHM 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1" />
</usx>